IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `npba-board`

-- National Parks Board Act 1996, ss 4(2), 10, 11, 19, 29, 30, 31, 32 and First, Second and Third Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_national-parks-board-act-1996.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a member with nothing against them` MEANS Member WITH
    `undischarged bankrupt` IS FALSE
    `has made an arrangement with creditors` IS FALSE
    `months of imprisonment sentenced` IS 0
    `received a free pardon` IS FALSE
    `has a mental disorder` IS FALSE
    `incapable of managing own affairs` IS FALSE
    `consecutive meetings missed without leave` IS 0

